    "directions": [
      "In a bowl add all the ingredients and knead a semi soft dough.",
      "In a bowl, add all the ingredients and mix well and set aside.",
      "Take a portion from the dough and roll it out.",
      "Then roast it from both sides half way through. Now set it aside and heat oil in the same pan and pour the egg mixture and spread it around.",
      "Place the half cooked paratha on it then flip it and cook from both sides until cooked properly.",
      "Remove and serve."
